          "explanation": "A career public-servant appointment to a cabinet post is a positive competence signal."
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "E0096",
          "explanation": "The Federal Police conclusion against a stronger interference claim limits how far the obstruction allegation can be pushed."
        }
