          "explanation": "The family-finance investigation and suspicious transaction reporting create a concrete personal-nexus concern."
        }
      ],
      "inherited_baseline_and_constraints": "Brazil's polarized media and corruption environment is context only. The score turns on Bolsonaro's own rhetoric, appointments, and family-linked scrutiny, not on general institutional weakness.",
      "ruler_attribution": "Direct for public rhetoric and appointments, indirect for family-finance concerns, and mixed for the interference inquiry. The pattern is one of repeated confrontation with truth-tellers and recurring suspicion around family-linked conduct.",
      "supported_lenses": [
        "7B.1",
