      "inherited_baseline_and_constraints": "DRC corruption and weak oversight are context only. The score turns on the president's own appointments, his office network, and the recorded adviser-corruption episode, not on the country's general governance baseline.",
      "ruler_attribution": "Moderate. The strongest personal nexus runs through appointments and the office network rather than direct proof that Tshisekedi personally profited. The record shows both corrective moves and patronage-compatible choices.",
